        "semantic_nodes": [
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/7570",
            "canonical_text": "7.2.1 Activating the coupled mode",
            "semantic_order": 7621,
            "node_type": "heading",
            "page_no": 350,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 157.2605743408203,
              "y0": 259.50421142578125,
              "x1": 359.00946044921875,
              "y1": 247.67221069335938
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/7571",
            "canonical_text": "You can couple the CT scanner and the bolus injector so that you can start and stop both systems, and transfer the injection parameters between the two systems. The scanner gets extended operational control over the bolus injector. The scanner is able to retrieve information from the bolus injector about the applied injection.",
            "semantic_order": 7622,
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "page_no": 350,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 198.41650390625,
              "y0": 233.9315185546875,
              "x1": 538.1563110351562,
              "y1": 189.1475067138672
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/7572",
            "canonical_text": "If you paste or repeat a coupled range, the new range is reset to uncoupled.",
            "semantic_order": 7623,
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "page_no": 350,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 199.23158264160156,
              "y0": 170.6815185546875,
              "x1": 495.80853271484375,
              "y1": 161.8975067138672
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/7573",
            "canonical_text": "You can see the status of the bolus injector by different icons in the status bar of the monitor:",
            "semantic_order": 7624,
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "page_no": 350,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 198.4124755859375,
              "y0": 133.50634765625,
              "x1": 513.4935302734375,
              "y1": 114.65734100341797
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/7574",
            "canonical_text": "Force / Force Velo | Instructions for Use Print No. C2-058-C.621.01.01.02",
            "semantic_order": 7625,
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "page_no": 350,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 57.246402740478516,
              "y0": 37.01922607421875,
              "x1": 173.44039916992188,
              "y1": 23.020727157592773
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/7575",
            "canonical_text": "SOMATOM | syngo CT VB30 350",
            "semantic_order": 7626,
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "page_no": 350,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 457.07623291015625,
              "y0": 36.71372604370117,
              "x1": 538.2807006835938,
              "y1": 22.736957550048828
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/7576",
            "canonical_text": "7 Enhanced examination",
            "semantic_order": 7627,
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "page_no": 351,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 455.0859375,
              "y0": 814.5802001953125,
              "x1": 563.35595703125,
              "y1": 807.650146484375
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/7578",
            "canonical_text": "By selecting Edit > Save Scan Protocol from the main menu, you can save scan protocols with Injector coupled as predefined scan start.",
            "semantic_order": 7628,
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "page_no": 351,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 199.17181396484375,
              "y0": 588.4790649414062,
              "x1": 510.0588684082031,
              "y1": 567.6050415039062
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/texts/7579",
            "canonical_text": "Scan ranges are marked within the chronicle to distinguish an unscanned from an already finished or uncoupled scan range.",
            "semantic_order": 7629,
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "page_no": 351,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 198.82980346679688,
              "y0": 549.1570434570312,
              "x1": 519.0858154296875,
              "y1": 528.373046875
            }
          },
          {
            "node_id": "#/tables/32",
            "canonical_text": "Icon | Meaning\n | Bolus injector coupling rejected\n | Bolus injector available\n | Bolus injector ready\n | Local procedure on bolus injector active",
            "semantic_order": 7630,
            "node_type": "table",
            "page_no": 351,
            "bbox": {
              "x0": 198.58592224121094,
              "y0": 742.8725051879883,
